config BR2_PACKAGE_WESTON_TOUCH
    bool "weston-touch module"
    depends on BR2_USE_MMU
    depends on BR2_TOOLCHAIN_HAS_THREADS
    select BR2_PACKAGE_WESTON
    select BR2_PACKAGE_WAYLAND
    help
      weston-touch.so, the weston module that adds a touch device and a key
      injector to the compositor's seat. rawlink drives it over a unix socket
      so touch and the panel keys reach the app as real wayland input.

      The module is compiled with -DLIVI_WESTON_MAJOR matching the weston
      package, because weston 16 changed the touch and keyboard APIs.
